#: rootfs/usr/share/metainfo/org.mainuan.Welcome.metainfo.xml.in:7
msgid ""
"Welcome application of the Mainuan desktop. It helps new users choose the "
"look of the desktop, install media codecs, the antivirus, the firewall, "
"office suites and web browsers, and find the video tutorials."
